prepare a statement,

288
00:16:50,279 --> 00:16:51,200
but don't release it yet.

289
00:16:51,200 --> 00:16:52,320
Wait until we figure this out.

290
00:16:52,960 --> 00:16:53,399
Understood.

291
00:16:54,000 --> 00:16:54,799
And President Yan...

292
00:16:58,720 --> 00:16:59,519
President Yan,

293
00:17:00,519 --> 00:17:01,879
contact our friends in the media.

294
00:17:02,360 --> 00:17:02,879
See if they can

295
00:17:02,879 --> 00:17:04,279
push some positive press releases

296
00:17:04,480 --> 00:17:05,759
to ease the public pressure.

297
00:17:07,880 --> 00:17:08,680
Xiao Yang,

298
00:17:09,039 --> 00:17:09,880
contact the media.

299
00:17:10,160 --> 00:17:10,960
Contact the media!

300
00:17:11,200 --> 00:17:12,359
Get us off Trending!

301
00:17:14,880 --> 00:17:15,759
What if...

302
00:17:15,759 --> 00:17:17,400
we can't divert the topic?

303
00:17:17,759 --> 00:17:19,079
If we can't divert it,

304
00:17:19,759 --> 00:17:21,200
we'll face the problem head-on.

305
00:17:23,680 --> 00:17:24,480
Everyone,

306
00:17:24,759 --> 00:17:26,440
prepare Crisis PR countermeasures,

307
00:17:26,720 --> 00:17:27,680
including

308
00:17:28,319 --> 00:17:29,279
releasing a statement,

309
00:17:29,279 --> 00:17:30,119
a media Q&A,

310
00:17:30,119 --> 00:17:31,240
and follow-up actions.

311
00:17:31,680 --> 00:17:32,759
The company can't withstand

312
00:17:32,880 --> 00:17:34,319
this kind of loss of trust.

313
00:17:34,519 --> 00:17:35,400
Do you understand?

314
00:17:35,519 --> 00:17:35,839
Understood.

315
00:17:35,839 --> 00:17:36,519
Understood, understood.

316
00:17:37,759 --> 00:17:38,880
Do as President An says.

317
00:17:40,079 --> 00:17:40,880
Okay, okay. Don't be afraid.

318
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:41,720
Take your time.

319
00:17:43,200 --> 00:17:44,119
Give it a try.

320
00:17:44,519 --> 00:17:45,079
That's right.

321
00:17:46,720 --> 00:17:47,519
You go that way.

322
00:17:47,960 --> 00:17:48,960
Let's try taking a walk.

323
00:18:08,440 --> 00:18:09,559
Auntie Lin,

324
00:18:12,160 --> 00:18:12,960
Xiao Shen,

325
00:18:13,319 --> 00:18:15,480
You seem a bit distracted today.

326
00:18:16,240 --> 00:18:17,039
Do I?

327
00:18:17,400 --> 00:18:19,240
Maybe it's because the water is a bit cold today.

328
00:18:19,480 --> 00:18:20,599
I'm not feeling too well.

329
00:18:22,160 --> 00:18:23,759
Why isn't President Lin getting in the water with us?

330
00:18:25,680 --> 00:18:26,799
Coach Shen.

331
00:18:27,200 --> 00:18:28,519
President Lin is pregnant.

332
00:18:30,039 --> 00:18:30,960
Pregnant?

333
00:18:31,480 --> 00:18:32,839
I really couldn't tell.

334
00:18:33,359 --> 00:18:34,559
You've kept your figure so well.

335
00:18:35,160 --> 00:18:36,240
I'm a little tired.

336
00:18:37,039 --> 00:18:38,119
Go rest for a while if you're tired.

337
00:18:39,119 --> 00:18:39,759
President Lin.

338
00:18:40,079 --> 00:18:41,160
You need to take care of your health.

339
00:18:41,160 --> 00:18:41,880
Don't catch a cold.

340
00:18:41,880 --> 00:18:42,599
Drink some hot water.

341
00:18:43,000 --> 00:18:44,400
Be mindful of the baby.

342
00:18:46,519 --> 00:18:47,519
Mind your own business.

343
00:18:48,720 --> 00:18:49,519
Mom.

344
00:18:49,920 --> 00:18:51,119
There's an emergency at the company.

345
00:18:51,119 --> 00:18:52,680
I need to go handle it.

346
00:18:52,880 --> 00:18:54,039
I can't stay with you today.

347
00:18:54,039 --> 00:18:56,559
They say men who work hard are the most charming.

348
00:18:57,160 --> 00:18:59,400
But honestly, I think women who focus on their careers...

349
00:18:59,400 --> 00:19:00,839
...have a certain charm too.

350
00:19:01,119 --> 00:19:02,480
Was I talking to you?

351
00:19:10,079 --> 00:19:10,480
Let's go.

352
00:19:10,640 --> 00:19:12,039
L-let's practice some more.

353
00:19:13,319 --> 00:19:14,000
Don't be mad.

354
00:19:14,039 --> 00:19:14,680
Don't be mad.

355
00:19:29,759 --> 00:19:30,559
Xiaoxiao,

356
00:19:33,039 --> 00:19:34,839
I have some bad news for you.

357
00:19:35,240 --> 00:19:36,640
You need to brace yourself.

358
00:19:37,559 --> 00:19:38,359
Master.

359
00:19:38,599 --> 00:19:40,400
I know I haven't been at my best lately.

360
00:19:40,920 --> 00:19:42,000
I'll get back on track.

361
00:19:42,000 --> 00:19:42,799
Don't worry.

362
00:19:46,119 --> 00:19:47,240
You're fired.

363
00:19:47,920 --> 00:19:49,519
It's a decision from upper management.

364
00:19:49,720 --> 00:19:51,559
The recent online scandal had a huge impact.

365
00:19:51,799 --> 00:19:52,599
And as for you...

366
00:19:52,640 --> 00:19:54,319
...a lot of colleagues complained about you.

367
00:19:54,319 --> 00:19:55,480
So there's no other choice.

368
00:19:55,599 --> 00:19:56,640
I fought for you.

369
00:19:57,079 --> 00:19:59,000
But I couldn't sway their decision.

370
00:20:00,839 --> 00:20:02,200
You've been with me for so many years.

371
00:20:02,400 --> 00:20:03,720
I won't treat you unfairly.

372
00:20:04,319 --> 00:20:05,720
Even outside the company...

373
00:20:05,839 --> 00:20:06,559
...you and I...

374
00:20:06,839 --> 00:20:08,079
...will always be Master and apprentice.

375
00:20:08,400 --> 00:20:10,599
I've worked my fingers to the bone for you for years!

376
00:20:11,559 --> 00:20:13,240
I've done so much of your dirty work!

377
00:20:14,079 --> 00:20:15,279
Even if I don't get any credit...

378
00:20:15,279 --> 00:20:16,359
...my hard work should count for something, right?

379
00:20:17,039 --> 00:20:17,880
And now...

380
00:20:17,880 --> 00:20:19,599
...you're trying to fool me with this crap?

381
00:20:20,160 --> 00:20:21,599
You want to just kick me to the curb?

382
00:20:22,240 --> 00:20:23,039
Not a chance!

383
00:20:23,839 --> 00:20:24,839
As for what happened to Chu Yan...

384
00:20:25,319 --> 00:20:27,160
...you were the mastermind behind it.

385
00:20:27,759 --> 00:20:28,960
I was just a minor player...

386
00:20:29,200 --> 00:20:31,039
...who added fuel to the fire.

387
00:20:31,039 --> 00:20:32,680
If I tell everyone the truth...

388
00:20:33,839 --> 00:20:34,599
...do you think your fate...

389
00:20:34,920 --> 00:20:36,400
...will be any better than mine?

390
00:20:55,160 --> 00:20:57,039
The wine influencer who visited Gufeng Group the other day

391
00:20:57,039 --> 00:20:58,559
highly praised our warm hospitality

392
00:20:58,960 --> 00:21:00,519
and specifically complimented Chu Yan,

393
00:21:00,799 --> 00:21:02,039
saying she has great potential.

394
00:21:03,160 --> 00:21:05,160
His feature article has been published online,

395
00:21:05,279 --> 00:21:06,759
and the feedback from netizens is extremely enthusiastic.

396
00:21:07,000 --> 00:21:08,119
You did a great job.

397
00:21:08,480 --> 00:21:09,279
From now on,

398
00:21:09,440 --> 00:21:11,599
find more talents like Chu Yan.

399
00:21:11,720 --> 00:21:12,599
Understood?

400
00:21:39,720 --> 00:21:40,519
President Lin.

401
00:21:40,759 --> 00:21:42,920
I saw how much that influencer valued her.

402
00:21:42,920 --> 00:21:44,599
I just wanted to get a piece of the pie.

403
00:21:48,000 --> 00:21:49,119
I'm sorry, President Lin.

404
00:21:49,119 --> 00:21:49,880
I'm sorry.

405
00:21:51,720 --> 00:21:52,680
So quick to spill your guts, huh?

406
00:21:52,920 --> 00:21:53,720
President Lin.

407
00:21:54,319 --> 00:21:55,319
Everything went smoothly.

408
00:21:56,119 --> 00:21:56,920
Good.

409
00:21:57,279 --> 00:21:58,359
Keep an eye on her.

410
00:21:58,640 --> 00:22:00,279
Let her do what she's supposed to do.

411
00:22:30,839 --> 00:22:31,640
Then

412
00:22:32,279 --> 00:22:33,519
what do you want?

413
00:22:33,519 --> 00:22:34,279
Cut the crap.

414
00:22:34,640 --> 00:22:35,480
Five million.

415
00:22:36,079 --> 00:22:36,960
And I'll step out of Gufeng Group.

416
00:22:37,279 --> 00:22:39,240
I won't say another word about your dirty deeds.

417
00:22:47,319 --> 00:22:48,319
In here

418
00:22:48,480 --> 00:22:51,640
is all the evidence of you bullying Chu Yan and Zhao Yue.

419
00:22:52,400 --> 00:22:53,200
Guess

420
00:22:54,039 --> 00:22:56,680
if the truth of Chu Yan's death is exposed,

421
00:22:57,400 --> 00:22:59,680
who will be seen as the real murderer?

422
00:23:02,160 --> 00:23:02,960
Tear it up.

423
00:23:03,839 --> 00:23:04,880
Tear it all you want.

424
00:23:05,400 --> 00:23:07,119
I definitely have backups of this.

425
00:23:11,079 --> 00:23:12,279
There's money in here.

426
00:23:13,079 --> 00:23:14,279
I advise you to take it

427
00:23:14,440 --> 00:23:16,559
and pack your things and leave immediately.

428
00:23:17,400 --> 00:23:18,960
Don't make things end up

429
00:23:18,960 --> 00:23:20,000
looking ugly for everyone.

430
00:23:23,759 --> 00:23:24,920
Just you wait.

431
00:23:25,400 --> 00:23:26,359
This whole thing

432
00:23:26,440 --> 00:23:28,160
won't be settled so easily.

433
00:23:31,160 --> 00:23:31,960
Dongdong,

434
00:23:32,119 --> 00:23:34,000
with the surveillance and hacker stuff,

435
00:23:34,079 --> 00:23:35,279
thanks so much for your help.

436
00:23:35,799 --> 00:23:37,119
Dongdong really knows his stuff.

437
00:23:37,799 --> 00:23:39,079
He's faster than my own guys.

438
00:23:39,079 --> 00:23:41,039
He's more talented than we thought.

439
00:23:53,000 --> 00:23:53,720
Sang Luo.

440
00:23:54,839 --> 00:23:55,720
Let me see.

441
00:24:08,039 --> 00:24:08,839
All done.

442
00:24:09,319 --> 00:24:10,119
Take a look.

443
00:24:10,640 --> 00:24:11,440
It's fixed.

444
00:24:14,960 --> 00:24:16,680
When did you learn all this?

445
00:24:16,680 --> 00:24:18,119
I'm at home every day.

446
00:24:18,279 --> 00:24:19,079
With computers,

447
00:24:19,319 --> 00:24:20,559
you just learn by playing around.

448
00:24:22,240 --> 00:24:23,599
If you ever have any computer issues,

449
00:24:23,720 --> 00:24:24,400
Sang Luo,

450
00:24:24,440 --> 00:24:25,559
you can always come to me.

451
00:24:26,240 --> 00:24:27,960
What else can you do besides this?

452
00:24:28,920 --> 00:24:30,240
Network technology.

453
00:24:32,119 --> 00:24:34,359
Anyway, anything related to basic computing,

454
00:24:34,559 --> 00:24:35,920
I know a little bit about.

455
00:24:37,400 --> 00:24:39,440
Does that mean you're like a...

456
00:24:39,559 --> 00:24:40,519
hacker?

457
00:24:40,960 --> 00:24:41,759
Hack...

458
00:24:42,279 --> 00:24:43,079
Sang Luo,

459
00:24:43,480 --> 00:24:45,000
I haven't done anything bad!

460
00:24:45,160 --> 00:24:45,960
I...

461
00:24:53,480 --> 00:24:54,279
Sang Luo,

462
00:24:55,160 --> 00:24:56,240
about this...

463
00:24:56,440 --> 00:24:58,240
could you not tell Grandma?

464
00:24:59,039 --> 00:25:00,759
She doesn't like me messing with this stuff.

465
00:25:01,079 --> 00:25:02,160
She always thinks

466
00:25:02,920 --> 00:25:04,400
I'm not doing anything serious.

467
00:25:04,839 --> 00:25:05,640
Okay.

468
00:25:08,880 --> 00:25:09,920
Letting him help you

469
00:25:10,680 --> 00:25:12,160
is the greatest validation for him.

470
00:25:17,079 --> 00:25:18,240
Being able to help you, Sang Luo,

471
00:25:18,480 --> 00:25:19,359
makes me really happy.

472
00:25:20,240 --> 00:25:22,440
Now that Xiaoxiao has fallen out with Lin Wanmei,

473
00:25:24,119 --> 00:25:25,039
all we need is someone

474
00:25:25,039 --> 00:25:26,200
to give them a little push.

475
00:25:43,519 --> 00:25:44,960
You altered my decision without authorization,

476
00:25:44,960 --> 00:25:45,839
stopping the employees from working overtime.

477
00:25:45,839 --> 00:25:47,359
Are you trying to provoke me?

478
00:25:49,119 --> 00:25:51,039
The R&D department is tired enough already.

479
00:25:51,400 --> 00:25:53,559
I just don't want more people going crazy, okay?

480
00:25:53,960 --> 00:25:55,440
Gufeng Group is not a charity.

481
00:25:55,799 --> 00:25:57,559
I pay them such high salaries,

482
00:25:57,759 --> 00:25:59,839
so they must create the value I demand.

483
00:26:01,359 --> 00:26:02,160
President Lin.

484
00:26:03,119 --> 00:26:05,599
Is the value you demand driving employees crazy

485
00:26:05,920 --> 00:26:07,680
and having them bring down Gufeng Group with a lawsuit?

486
00:26:08,000 --> 00:26:09,039
Do you have any idea

487
00:26:09,039 --> 00:26:11,319
that Zhao Yue's parents already sued you at the Department of Labor?

488
00:26:11,839 --> 00:26:13,799
It's because of your negligence as a manager

489
00:26:13,920 --> 00:26:16,200
that Xiaoxiao was able to bully Zhao Yue at work.

490
00:26:16,240 --> 00:26:18,079
This was already a liability for Gufeng Group.

491
00:26:18,200 --> 00:26:20,640
If I hadn't compensated Zhao Yue's parents,

492
00:26:21,680 --> 00:26:23,759
do you think you'd still be standing here talking to me?

493
00:26:24,039 --> 00:26:24,599
These documents

494
00:26:24,599 --> 00:26:26,200
would already be on a desk at the Department of Labor.

495
00:26:26,200 --> 00:26:27,519
Could you bear the consequences?

496
00:26:29,119 --> 00:26:29,920
Fine.

497
00:26:30,720 --> 00:26:32,279
You win.

498
00:26:36,519 --> 00:26:37,599
Psycho.

499
00:26:37,799 --> 00:26:38,680
Unbelievable.

500
00:26:44,960 --> 00:26:46,079
Kill two birds with one stone.

501
00:26:48,720 --> 00:26:50,079
You used the ghost incident

502
00:26:50,359 --> 00:26:52,200
to abolish Lin Wanmei's overtime rule.

503
00:26:53,079 --> 00:26:54,440
You dealt a blow to her authority,

504
00:26:54,759 --> 00:26:56,680
drove a wedge between her and Xiaoxiao,

505
00:26:57,559 --> 00:26:59,400
and won over the R&D department.

506
00:27:00,160 --> 00:27:01,640
Isn't that killing two birds with one stone?

507
00:27:03,400 --> 00:27:04,960
What are you gonna do about it?

508
00:27:06,119 --> 00:27:07,359
I don't want to do anything to you.

509
00:27:07,759 --> 00:27:08,759
But I know

510
00:27:13,480 --> 00:27:14,480
that your true goal

511
00:27:15,759 --> 00:27:18,000
is not just about Chu Yan, is it?
